📊 Financial Performance Analysis, Forecasting & Budgeting Excel Dashboard (2015–2024)
🔎 Business Problem

Organizations require accurate forecasting and budgeting systems to improve profitability, optimize costs, and support strategic planning.

Without financial forecasting frameworks, leadership teams risk:

inaccurate budgeting
declining profit margins
inefficient resource allocation
delayed strategic decisions

This project answers the business question:

How can management improve profitability and forecasting accuracy using historical financial data?

